Clients consume the generated schema contract. Keep TypeScript, Swift, and Kotlin behavior aligned with `docs/cross-platform-client-contract.md`.

Use `@frick/react` for React UI, `@frick/core` for UI-agnostic TypeScript runtime work, generated Swift/Kotlin DTOs for native clients, and generated design packages for platform tokens.
